#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You have already signed in another way, but have not confirmed your account.\nYou can confirm your account using the link we sent to you, or by resetting your password.\n"
msgstr "Anda sudah masuk dengan cara lain, tetapi belum mengonfirmasi akun Anda.\nAnda dapat mengonfirmasi akun melalui tautan yang kami kirimkan, atau dengan mereset kata sandi Anda.\n"

